"{\n \"url\": \"https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/Audio-Feedback-System-Breakdown-3b37216d8bc5801faee4c55b1d11e949\",\n \"text\": \"Skip to content\\nPray For Plagues, Souls-borne Prototype\\n/\\nSystems Documentation\\n/\\nAudio & Feedback System Breakdown\\nGet Notion free\\nAudio & Feedback System Breakdown\\n4 more properties\\nOverview\\nThe Audio & Feedback Systems are designed to reinforce clarity, impact, and emotional pacing throughout combat and exploration. These systems combine dynamic audio behavior with responsive visual feedback to ensure that every action—whether a footstep, a weapon strike, or a boss phase transition—feels grounded and intentional. Each sound effect is followed with an optional visual effects or decals that are applied on the player, enemy or world.\\nIn order to showcase all mentioned systems, please watch the full gameplay video, where all mentioned systems come into play.\\nDynamic Boss Soundtrack Manager\\nA key component is the Dynamic Soundtrack Manager, which controls music transitions during boss encounters. The manager monitors boss health thresholds and phase changes, seamlessly shifting between soundtrack layers to match the intensity of the fight. This creates a reactive audio experience where music escalates as the encounter becomes more dangerous, enhancing tension and player immersion.\\nDynamic Footstep System\\nMoment‑to‑moment feedback is supported by the Dynamic Footstep System, which adjusts sound effects, particle effects, and decals based on the surface the player is walking on. Each material type—stone, dirt, metal, water—triggers its own audio and visual response, making movement feel connected to the environment and improving spatial awareness.\\nDynamic Combat Hit VFX/SFX and Camera Shake\\nCombat feedback is tightly integrated with the damage pipeline. Successful hits trigger distinct impact sounds and VFX, while parries and counterattacks play unique audio cues to emphasize timing and mastery. These responses are driven by gameplay events, animation notifies and customizable sound cues, ensuring that audio and visual feedback remain perfectly synchronized with combat actions.\\nShare site\\nAudio & Feedback System …\\nGet Notion free\\nAudio & Feedback System …\\nOverview\\nCopy URL\\nSign up or log in\\nReport page\\nCookie settings\\nStrictly necessary\\nEssential for the site to function. Always On.\\nFunctional\\nUsed to remember preference selections and provide enhanced features.\\nAnalytics\\nUsed to measure usage and improve your experience.\\nMarketing\\nUsed for targeted advertising.\",\n \"media\": [\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/icons/laptop_gray.svg?mode=dark\",\n  \"IMG: https://file.notion.so/f/f/9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9/e36c6318-ac37-45ba-a300-1b7db0cfefa5/d50e818b213971ee83500fadd4a2d6b11a63ac0ad3a2aeba.avif?table=block&id=3b37216d-8bc5-801f-aee4-c55b1d11e949&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&expirationTimestamp=1786896000000&signature=Om1ftz3PYQfEIXkIFTDalYgIC6FvFNgFtLP6ASDsOSI\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A8aaf1ce9-5e13-481e-bcb6-28418e0a20b1%3AScreenshot_2026-08-08_223536.png?table=block&id=3b67216d-8bc5-8032-9298-dff8aca2b48a&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1260&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A601ffc9e-53a8-4455-a5c1-f27608429161%3AScreenshot_2026-08-08_223431.png?table=block&id=3b67216d-8bc5-80e2-ad71-d37f9b911aa4&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1260&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\",\n  \"IMG: https://vine-mandevilla-7ed.notion.site/image/attachment%3A44770f63-e889-4716-9da5-d98c2cbf2ad1%3AScreenshot_2026-08-08_223730.png?table=block&id=3b67216d-8bc5-805e-855c-cac30b233d4b&spaceId=9ee7216d-8bc5-81ea-ab4d-0003a2e97de9&width=1260&userId=&cache=v2&imgBuildSrc=requestProxiedImageUrl\"\n ]\n}"